  data: {
    LLM: '1. Setup: all 28 tiles are placed face down in a 4×7 grid. 2. On your turn, expose any two tiles. If the pair totals 12, remove them from the grid and take another turn (continue until you fail to get a total of 12). If the pair does not total 12, turn them face down again and the next player takes a turn. 3. The hand is over when the grid is empty. 4. Winner is the first to reach 50 captured tiles (25 pairs) or the agreed total.',
    Player: '1. Setup: all 28 tiles are placed face down in a 4×7 grid. 2. On your turn, expose any two tiles. If the pair totals 12, remove them from the grid and take another turn (continue until you fail to get a total of 12). If the pair does not total 12, turn them face down again and the next player takes a turn. 3. The hand is over when the grid is empty. 4. Winner is the first to reach 50 captured tiles (25 pairs) or the agreed total.',
    objective: 'Be the first player to reach 50 captured tiles (25 pairs), or another predetermined total, by turning up pairs of tiles that total 12.',
    gameplay: '1. Setup: all 28 tiles are placed face down in a 4×7 grid. 2. On your turn, expose any two tiles. If the pair totals 12, remove them from the grid and take another turn (continue until you fail to get a total of 12). If the pair does not total 12, turn them face down again and the next player takes a turn. 3. The hand is over when the grid is empty. 4. Winner is the first to reach 50 captured tiles (25 pairs) or the agreed total.',
    keyRules: [
      'Each turn: expose two tiles. If they total 12, remove them and go again; otherwise turn them face down and pass the turn.',
